                "text": "As a survivor of stage four cancer, I know the value of personalized and holistic cancer care planning and of a supportive community. I was proud to join @CancerSupportSF at their groundbreaking for a new facility in Lafayette that will serve even more patients and families impacted by cancer here in CA-10 and across the Bay Area.",
