                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Under the Republican\u2019s One Big Ugly Bill, more than 300 rural hospitals could close putting further strain on suburban care centers, including those in our community. Tune in to hear about the impact this could have on CA-10 and about my work this week to resist the Trump Administration\u2019s extreme agenda.",
