                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Republican\u2019s One Big Ugly Bill would kick more than 10 million people off of their health care coverage in the next decade and threaten services for the more than 45,000 children and 19,000 seniors in CA-10 who access their health care through Medicaid. \n\nI recently sat down with health care providers at the Contra Costa County Regional Medical Center to discuss the impact this devastating budget bill would have on our community and the strain it would place on hospitals.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
