                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Health care premiums are about to go up by an average of 75% for more than 20 million Americans thanks to Republicans\u2019 refusal to extend a program that reduces costs for American families. I and my @HouseDemocrats colleagues have made it clear \u2013 we won\u2019t support a government funding bill that fails to address this looming crisis.\nhttps://t.co/sAksKNr5qQ",
                "text_lang": "en",
