                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Yesterday I gathered health care providers from CA-10 to discuss the impacts of the shutdown and the Republicans\u2019 unwillingness to extend tax credits that lower costs for American families\u2019 health insurance premiums. This conversation made clear that higher costs, worse care, and more uninsured patients hurt us all.",
