                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I sat down with @NBCBayArea to discuss the devastating effects the Republican shutdown is having on our community, including for federal workers and seniors, and why Democrats are fighting so hard to ensure your health care premiums do not go up, which is what will happen if Republicans get their way.",
