                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Are you and your family being impacted by the federal government shutdown? Would your health care premiums spike if Republicans allow the Affordable Care Act tax credits to expire? I want to hear from you! Share your experiences with our office at https://t.co/CovzSegJBJ use #ShutdownStories.",
